<title>USA: Va. Building Auth $152 mln repriced, 5.75 in 2017.</title>
<headline>Va. Building Auth $152 mln repriced, 5.75 in 2017.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
